            0.125
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "SUMMARY"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 2,
          "bbox": [
            0.176,
            0.137,
            0.822,
            0.174
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "An algebraic equation is a mathematical statement that indicates the equality of two algebraic expressions."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
            0.176,
            0.175,
            0.822,
            0.212
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "When the same operation is performed on both sides of an equation, equality is maintained."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.176,
            0.213,
            0.823,
            0.25
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Finding a solution to an equation means finding the values of the unknowns in the expressions such that the LHS is equal to the RHS."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.176,
            0.251,
            0.823,
            0.289
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Equations can often be solved by performing the same operation on both sides so that the value of the unknown becomes evident."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.435,
            0.355,
            0.575,
            0.377
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "LIT's PUZZLE TIME!"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "doc_title",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.436,
            0.389,
            0.586,
            0.41
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "A Magic Trick"
            }
          ],
          "level": 1
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.193,
            0.44,
            0.397,
            0.459
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Think of any number."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.192,
            0.459,
            0.394,
            0.479
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Now multiply it by 2."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.192,
            0.479,
            0.27,
            0.497
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Add 10."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 11,
          "bbox": [
            0.192,
            0.498,
            0.307,
            0.516
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Divide by 2."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 12,
          "bbox": [
            0.191,
            0.516,
            0.666,
            0.536
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Now subtract the original number you thought of."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 13,
          "bbox": [
            0.191,
            0.536,
            0.329,
            0.556
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Finally, add 3."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 14,
          "bbox": [
            0.168,
            0.56,
            0.598,
            0.58
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "I predict that you now have 8. Am I correct?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 15,
          "bbox": [
            0.168,
            0.585,
            0.568,
            0.606
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Try the trick on your friends and family!"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 16,
          "bbox": [
            0.168,
            0.61,
            0.54,
            0.631
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Can you explain why the trick works?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 17,
          "bbox": [
            0.169,
